{"seq":2,"slug":"attributes-modifiers","title":"属性与修饰器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/gameplay-ability-systems/foundations/attributes-modifiers","wordCount":1201,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"属性与修饰器\">属性与修饰器</h1><p>考虑一个常见 bug：玩家攻击力 100，喝下「攻击力 +50%」的药水变成 150，药水到期后却变成了 100×... 等等，到底该减回多少？如果你天真地把当前值直接乘 1.5 再存回去，到期减回去时就会算错——尤其当期间又叠了别的 buff。这个「buff 叠加与到期还原」的算账问题，是技能系统属性建模的核心难题，而它的解法只有一个：把属性拆成两层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GAS 把每个 GameplayAttribute 拆成两个数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BaseValue（基础值）：属性的「永久」底值，只被瞬时（Instant）效果直接改写，比如升级永久加攻、永久减最大生命。</li>\n<li>CurrentValue（当前值）：在 BaseValue 之上，叠加所有当前生效的持续型修饰器后算出的「此刻真实值」。buff/debuff 改的是这一层，到期时只需把对应修饰器移除、重算 CurrentValue，BaseValue 毫发无损。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上面那个药水问题因此迎刃而解：药水是一个持续效果，它给攻击力挂一个「×1.5」的修饰器，CurrentValue=100×1.5=150；到期移除该修饰器，CurrentValue 重算回 100×（无其它修饰）=100。BaseValue 始终是 100，从不参与这场临时运算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Base[&quot;BaseValue 基础值&lt;br/&gt;例: 攻击力 100&quot;] --&gt; Agg[&quot;聚合器 Aggregator&lt;br/&gt;按顺序应用修饰器&quot;]&#10;  M1[&quot;Add 加法修饰&lt;br/&gt;+20 (装备)&quot;] --&gt; Agg&#10;  M2[&quot;Multiply 乘法修饰&lt;br/&gt;x1.5 (药水)&quot;] --&gt; Agg&#10;  M3[&quot;Override 覆盖修饰&lt;br/&gt;=1 (诅咒,可选)&quot;] --&gt; Agg&#10;  Agg --&gt; Cur[&quot;CurrentValue 当前值&lt;br/&gt;= clamp 后的此刻真实值&quot;]&#10;  Cur --&gt; Clamp[PreAttributeChange&lt;br/&gt;钳制 [0, Max]&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  Base[\"BaseValue 基础值&lt;br/&gt;例: 攻击力 100\"] --&gt; Agg[\"聚合器 Aggregator&lt;br/&gt;按顺序应用修饰器\"]\n  M1[\"Add 加法修饰&lt;br/&gt;+20 (装备)\"] --&gt; Agg\n  M2[\"Multiply 乘法修饰&lt;br/&gt;x1.5 (药水)\"] --&gt; Agg\n  M3[\"Override 覆盖修饰&lt;br/&gt;=1 (诅咒,可选)\"] --&gt; Agg\n  Agg --&gt; Cur[\"CurrentValue 当前值&lt;br/&gt;= clamp 后的此刻真实值\"]\n  Cur --&gt; Clamp[PreAttributeChange&lt;br/&gt;钳制 [0, Max]\"]</pre><h2 id=\"修饰器的三类运算与结算顺序\">修饰器的三类运算与结算顺序</h2><p>修饰器（Modifier）描述「怎么改一个属性」。GAS 定义四种运算，最常用前三种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算 Op</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Add</td>\n<td>加上一个值</td>\n<td>装备固定加攻、护甲减伤的减项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply</td>\n<td>乘以一个系数</td>\n<td>百分比增益/减益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divide</td>\n<td>除以一个值</td>\n<td>较少用，可由 Multiply 替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Override</td>\n<td>直接覆盖为某值</td>\n<td>强制设定（如「攻击力归零」诅咒）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结算顺序是确定且重要的：聚合器（Aggregator）先把所有 Add 求和，再统一应用 Multiply，最后用 Override（若有）覆盖。用 KaTeX 表达，忽略 Override 时当前值为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Current</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>Base</mtext><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Add</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Mul</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Current} = \\left(\\text{Base} + \\sum_i \\text{Add}_i\\right) \\times \\prod_j \\text{Mul}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Current</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Add</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mul</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意「先加后乘」的语义差异：装备 +20、药水 +50% 时，结果是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(100+20)\\times1.5=180</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span></span></span></span></span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>170</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\times1.5+20=170</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170</span></span></span></span></span>。这个顺序必须对策划透明，否则数值表会算错。若需要「最终值再加一笔」的语义，要用单独的后置 Add 通道或 Execution 计算，详见<a href=\"../effects-tags/gameplay-effects\">游戏效果</a>里的自定义结算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元属性与伤害管道\">元属性与伤害管道</h2><p>不是所有属性都长期存在。像「这次受到的伤害」这种只在一次结算中临时存在、用完即弃的量，叫元属性（Meta Attribute），典型是 <code>Damage</code> 与 <code>Healing</code>。它们的用法是：伤害效果不直接去减 Health，而是把伤害值写入 Damage 元属性，然后在 <code>PostGameplayEffectExecute</code> 钩子里读取 Damage、应用减伤公式、再从 Health 中扣除并把 Damage 清零。</p>\n<p>这样设计的好处是把「伤害怎么算」集中到一处可拦截的管道里：护盾吸收、暴击、伤害类型抗性、击杀判定都能挂在这个钩子上，而不必散落在每个技能里。这条管道是本 hub 与<a href=\"../../combat-system-design/\">战斗系统设计</a>的交汇点——战斗系统决定 hitbox 何时命中并算出原始伤害，本管道决定这笔伤害如何被属性层修正后落到血量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界守卫-钳制与依赖\">边界守卫：钳制与依赖</h2><p>属性不能随便越界：血量不能为负、不能超过最大值、暴击率不能超过 100%。GAS 用两个钩子守边界：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>PreAttributeChange</code>：在 CurrentValue 即将改变前调用，用于 clamp。例如把 Health 钳制到 <code>[0, MaxHealth]</code>。</li>\n<li><code>PreAttributeBaseChange</code>：在 BaseValue 即将改变前调用，用于钳制底值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>还有一类微妙问题：属性间的依赖。当 MaxHealth 因为 buff 上升时，当前 Health 是否要按比例上升？GAS 不会自动处理，需要你在 MaxHealth 变化的回调里显式调整 Health。忽略这点会导致「加最大生命 buff 后，血条比例诡异跳变」。这类依赖逻辑应集中在 AttributeSet 中，避免散落。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>属性分 BaseValue（永久底值）与 CurrentValue（叠加修饰后的此刻值），是 buff 正确叠加与还原的根本。</li>\n<li>修饰器三类运算 Add/Multiply/Override 按「先加后乘再覆盖」确定顺序结算，语义须对策划透明。</li>\n<li>元属性（Damage/Healing）把伤害集中进一条可拦截管道，是减伤、暴击、护盾的统一挂载点。</li>\n<li>用 PreAttributeChange 钳制边界，用变化回调处理属性间依赖，二者都集中在 AttributeSet。</li>\n<li>属性只能被效果修改——「怎么施加」是下一步，见效果篇。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：属性的唯一修改途径 → <a href=\"../effects-tags/gameplay-effects\">游戏效果</a>；属性挂在哪个组件、谁拥有 → <a href=\"ability-system-architecture\">技能系统架构</a>；技能何时提交属性消耗 → <a href=\"../effects-tags/cooldowns-costs\">冷却与消耗</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：把原始伤害交给本属性管道之前的命中判定 → <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">战斗系统设计 · 伤害公式与缩放</a>；属性数值曲线如何设计 → <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/number-systems-curves\">经济与平衡 · 数值系统与曲线</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"属性与修饰器","id":"属性与修饰器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"修饰器的三类运算与结算顺序","id":"修饰器的三类运算与结算顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"元属性与伤害管道","id":"元属性与伤害管道"},{"level":2,"text":"边界守卫：钳制与依赖","id":"边界守卫-钳制与依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"技能系统架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/gameplay-ability-systems/foundations/ability-system-architecture"},"next":{"title":"技能生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/gameplay-ability-systems/foundations/ability-lifecycle"}}